  "details": "I think it would be a good idea if there was an option to use the opposite hand of the expressions menu which is used for movement in VR when opened to point and click to navigate it like the smaller main menu, this would improve the use of the expressions menu for people who have drift and can't navigate it normally or who are using hand tracking. Please think on adding this to the game cause it would be a great ability for the users of VRChat. Thank you.",
